{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Move fast, think faster!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials is an intense, anime arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/Multiplayer-combo.gif?t=1745302021\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock in timed mode or go head-to-head against friends in versus battles. Choose from four operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/ss_01414f06c5976a94fefb5f5229651cc897f185f4.640x360.jpg?t=1745302021\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to multiply the fun and add to your skills with Times Trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/small_-_Nori3.png?t=1745302021\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351640?t=1745302021","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351640?t=1745302021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745302021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745302021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2646140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Indiegogo Launch</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to everyone who has helped make our Indiegogo a success! We will contact everyone individually for perk rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've missed out, there are a few rewards left:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Move fast, think faster!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials is an intense, anime arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/Multiplayer-combo.gif?t=1745302021\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock in timed mode or go head-to-head against friends in versus battles. Choose from four operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/ss_01414f06c5976a94fefb5f5229651cc897f185f4.640x360.jpg?t=1745302021\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to multiply the fun and add to your skills with Times Trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/small_-_Nori3.png?t=1745302021\" /></p>","developers":["Arc-Fy"],"dlc":[2646100],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/header.jpg?t=1745302021","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257075422,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075422/movie480.mp4?t=1732173418","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075422/movie_max.mp4?t=1732173418"},"name":"Gameplay Tailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075422/7d44ea05d60db29d5b508fcdd1b4d78cfbc48f46/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732173418","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075422/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1732173418","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075422/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1732173418"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256991878,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256991878/movie480.mp4?t=1704192315","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256991878/movie_max.mp4?t=1704192315"},"name":"Times Trials Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256991878/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1704192315","webm